sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BCO as BCO
    participant Store as BCO State store
    participant Selector as Commit selector
    participant BTO as Build-Test Orchestrator
    participant Analyzer as Results Analyzer
    participant Decision as Decision engine

    BCO->>Store: Acquire campaign lease
    BCO->>Store: Read campaign, steps, and next intended action
    BCO->>Selector: Commit-selection request
    Selector-->>BCO: One candidate commit
    BCO->>Store: Create step and persist next intended action
    BCO->>BTO: Submit build-test plan request with idempotency key
    BTO-->>BCO: Plan ID
    BCO->>Store: Persist plan attempt and await-plan action
    BCO->>Store: Release campaign lease
    BTO-->>BCO: Terminal-state notification
    BCO->>Store: Re-acquire campaign lease
    BCO->>BTO: Read final build-test plan result
    BTO-->>BCO: Final build-test plan result
    BCO->>Analyzer: Analyze plan output
    Analyzer-->>BCO: Observations or performance evidence
    BCO->>Decision: Evaluate evidence
    Decision-->>BCO: good / bad / skip / weak with rationale
    BCO->>Store: Persist attempt, decision, rationale, and next action
